    {
      "id": "lZ-4y83hdBa57EbpxvuyG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 725.4991587601029,
      "y": -1864.8078994027305,
      "width": 1247.7635498046875,
      "height": 1365,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 765197343,
      "version": 1127,
      "versionNonce": 1877107775,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781202862449,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tinder\n\nAn app where users create trier profiles view profiles of potential romantic mates, \nthey can swipe right to match and start a conversation, or left to not match.\nMate profiles are displayed based on distance, gender, and age filters.\n\nFunctional requirements\n1. Create profile, including pictures\n2. Search for mates\n3. See candidate details/pictures \n4. Swipe left/right on candidate mates\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1. Low latency for searching mates < 500ms\n2. Avalability over consistency\n3. Read intensive\n\nOut-of-scope\n- In app chat\n\nCore entities\n\nProfile (name, bio, gender, age, pictures, location)\nMatchCandidate (profile1, profile2, statusProfile1, statusProfile2, timestamp)\n\nAPI design\n\nPOST /profiles -> Profile\nheader: jwt\nbody: { name, bio, gender, age, pictures, location, minAge, maxAge, matchGender, maxRadius}\n\nPATCH /profile/{id}/location?lat={}&long={}\n\nGET /matchCandidates/{id} -> Profile[]\n\nPOST /swipe/{id}/{matchId}?diretion={right/left} -> Match\n\nGET /matches -> Profile[]\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tinder\n\nAn app where users create trier profiles view profiles of potential romantic mates, \nthey can swipe right to match and start a conversation, or left to not match.\nMate profiles are displayed based on distance, gender, and age filters.\n\nFunctional requirements\n1. Create profile, including pictures\n2. Search for mates\n3. See candidate details/pictures \n4. Swipe left/right on candidate mates\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1. Low latency for searching mates < 500ms\n2. Avalability over consistency\n3. Read intensive\n\nOut-of-scope\n- In app chat\n\nCore entities\n\nProfile (name, bio, gender, age, pictures, location)\nMatchCandidate (profile1, profile2, statusProfile1, statusProfile2, timestamp)\n\nAPI design\n\nPOST /profiles -> Profile\nheader: jwt\nbody: { name, bio, gender, age, pictures, location, minAge, maxAge, matchGender, maxRadius}\n\nPATCH /profile/{id}/location?lat={}&long={}\n\nGET /matchCandidates/{id} -> Profile[]\n\nPOST /swipe/{id}/{matchId}?diretion={right/left} -> Match\n\nGET /matches -> Profile[]\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
